":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\t\t  &amp;nbsp; Just wondered if there were any ROR brides here as the original post seems to be very dated. Im getting married Sep 2015 and am sooooooooooooooooooo excited. I have just found my dress this week and have had my shoes for a few weeks, still lots to do though!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879353,"PostDate":1417369184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Just wondered if there were any ROR brides here as the original post seems to be very dated. Im getting married Sep 2015 and am sooooooooooooooooooo excited. I have just found my dress this week and have had my shoes for a few weeks, still lots to do though!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iamsamara@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"176.254.4.178","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410378590,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsRogers","Id":279771,"Name":"FutureMrsRogers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2903058c1a0fcf6375626497d07b1d41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, I am getting married May,2015!!!!! Crazy time of year right now and trying to cram wedding planning in the middle lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879401,"PostDate":1417446394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I am getting married May,2015!!!!! Crazy time of year right now and trying to cram wedding planning in the middle lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay.vaillancourt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.252.61.182","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378745169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273327.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay2015","Id":273327,"Name":"kay2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.76.32.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by deejaywhit, 01 December 2014 - 12:50 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1417467049,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75594163c6e023c54149e04ef96a91cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Kay and FutureMrsRogers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married in March 2015 in Ocho Rios.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m cruising on Carnival Conquest, still trying to decide on the Carnival Wedding Package or going through an outside vendor on the island.&amp;nbsp; Any suggestions?&amp;nbsp; Congratulations to you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879412,"PostDate":1417466894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Kay and FutureMrsRogers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm getting married in March 2015 in Ocho Rios.\u00a0 I'm cruising on Carnival Conquest, still trying to decide on the Carnival Wedding Package or going through an outside vendor on the island.\u00a0 Any suggestions?\u00a0 Congratulations to you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deejaywhitaker@gmail.com","IpAddress":"130.76.32.198","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417465510,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"deejaywhit","Id":281285,"Name":"deejaywhit","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.57.212.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8206f129a37178213b625575c1314fa","RawContent":"Me too! Just under 4 months to go!","Attachments":[],"Id":1882450,"PostDate":1420857095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Me too! Just under 4 months to go!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chyla@cogeco.ca","IpAddress":"24.57.232.156","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308874362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241498.jpg?_r=1403755312","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"May12DPBBride","Id":241498,"Name":"May12DPBBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.128.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcfed0bde3e13dbde1ba6ac475c73875","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at RIU Ocho Rios in January 2016!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just starting the process ... Any advise, help, etc. would be appreciated ..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886754,"PostDate":1424293730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting married at RIU Ocho Rios in January 2016!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just starting the process ... Any advise, help, etc. would be appreciated ..<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tanvan1976@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"64.231.128.246","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424289586,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282157.png?_r=1425494284","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tan38","Id":282157,"Name":"tan38","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.162.169.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f51b9c8abf40b734c9a41dd0cddf337","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsRogers\" post=\"1879353\" timestamp=\"1417369184\"]\nHi Ladies\n\t\t    Just wondered if there were any ROR brides here as the original post seems to be very dated. Im getting married Sep 2015 and am sooooooooooooooooooo excited. I have just found my dress this week and have had my shoes for a few weeks, still lots to do though!!![\/quote]  [quote name=\"kay2015\" post=\"1879401\" timestamp=\"1417446394\"]\nHello, I am getting married May,2015!!!!! Crazy time of year right now and trying to cram wedding planning in the middle lol[\/quote]  [quote name=\"May12DPBBride\" post=\"1882450\" timestamp=\"1420857095\"]\nMe too! Just under 4 months to go![\/quote]  [quote name=\"tan38\" post=\"1886754\" timestamp=\"1424293730\"]\nI am getting married at RIU Ocho Rios in January 2016!\n \nJust starting the process ... Any advise, help, etc. would be appreciated ..[\/quote]Hey ladies,\n\nCongrats on your upcoming weddings!! Exciting!\n\nI&#039;m also hoping to get married at ROR in Dec 2015. ROR seems to be extremely slo with their email responses. Do any of you have pricing info from them (e.g. DJ, cost per person for open bar, extra flowers, locations for ceremony, etc)? If yes, do you mind sending them to me please?\n\nI&#039;m also wondering why there aren&#039;t that many recent reviews on ROR weddings. Hmm...\n\nAny help will be appreciated!\n\nThanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1889853,"PostDate":1426699593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsRogers, on 30 November 2014 - 09:39 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi Ladies<br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Just wondered if there were any ROR brides here as the original post seems to be very dated. Im getting married Sep 2015 and am sooooooooooooooooooo excited. I have just found my dress this week and have had my shoes for a few weeks, still lots to do though!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\u00a0\u00a0<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kay2015, on 01 December 2014 - 07:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello, I am getting married May,2015!!!!! Crazy time of year right now and trying to cram wedding planning in the middle lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\u00a0\u00a0<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>May12DPBBride, on 09 January 2015 - 06:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Me too! Just under 4 months to go!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\u00a0\u00a0<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tan38, on 18 February 2015 - 01:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I am getting married at RIU Ocho Rios in January 2016!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nJust starting the process ... Any advise, help, etc. would be appreciated ..<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHey ladies,<br><br>\nCongrats on your upcoming weddings!! Exciting!<br><br>\nI'm also hoping to get married at ROR in Dec 2015. ROR seems to be extremely slo with their email responses. Do any of you have pricing info from them (e.g. DJ, cost per person for open bar, extra flowers, locations for ceremony, etc)? If yes, do you mind sending them to me please?<br><br>\nI'm also wondering why there aren't that many recent reviews on ROR weddings. Hmm...<br><br>\nAny help will be appreciated!<br><br>\nThanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia.wm.yeh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420495609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Alicia328","Id":281612,"Name":"Alicia328","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.162.169.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78430,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c3352af3acb19bd3b789856ce34e891","RawContent":"[quote name=\"May12DPBBride\" post=\"1889948\" timestamp=\"1426740991\"]\nHi Alicia- have you joined the riu ocho rios brides page on Facebook? constant review, questions, etc. also I&#039;m a part of another group called Canadian destination brides on Facebook which is heavily active with amazing women on it.[\/quote]\nThank you! I will join those 2 fb groups. That was helpful :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1889972,"PostDate":1426772035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>May12DPBBride, on 18 March 2015 - 08:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi Alicia- have you joined the riu ocho rios brides page on Facebook? constant review, questions, etc. also I'm a part of another group called Canadian destination brides on Facebook which is heavily active with amazing women on it.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you! I will join those 2 fb groups. That was helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alicia.wm.yeh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.179.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420495609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Alicia328","Id":281612,"Name":"Alicia328","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78430","Title":"Any 2015 Riu Ocho Rios Brides?","LastPostDate":1426772035},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
