ave available entertainment-wise?... still waiting for Ana&#039;s email with the resort photographer&#039;s pics...","Attachments":[],"Id":574288,"PostDate":1233144603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are also wondering about the evening entertainment, has anyone had a chance to research about the town of Puerto Morelos and what they have available entertainment-wise?... still waiting for Ana's email with the resort photographer's pics...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3996a1468f654487b24a28609f9912b","RawContent":"I haven&#039;t heard anything about the entertainment...I remember reading some things about it on either tripadvisor or bookit, but I can&#039;t remember exactly what was said...I can&#039;t wait for the February OCT bride to come back and tell us about the resort and her wedding!! \n \n On another note, our wedding day has been booked for April 16th, 2009!! Yay!","Attachments":[],"Id":575967,"PostDate":1233267355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I haven't heard anything about the entertainment...I remember reading some things about it on either tripadvisor or bookit, but I can't remember exactly what was said...I can't wait for the February OCT bride to come back and tell us about the resort and her wedding!! <br \/> <br \/> On another note, our wedding day has been booked for April 16th, 2009!! Yay!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malina_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229916053,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"map","Id":213294,"Name":"map","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"508243fe2dc959092a5909fe51b568d6","RawContent":"Congratulations Map! That is awesome news :) we are really close to booking here as well, it will be so nice to finally book a resort!\n I received a few pictures (4 of them to be exact) from the resort&#039;s photographer. I&#039;ll try to post them on here. Personally, I don&#039;t think the pictures are the greatest, I&#039;ll try and ask Ana again if there&#039;s any other way around this...","Attachments":[],"Id":576759,"PostDate":1233306677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations Map! That is awesome news <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we are really close to booking here as well, it will be so nice to finally book a resort!<br \/> I received a few pictures (4 of them to be exact) from the resort's photographer. I'll try to post them on here. Personally, I don't think the pictures are the greatest, I'll try and ask Ana again if there's any other way around this...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc4fe53deec5c05949c0da627992223f","RawContent":"Hmm I seem to be having trouble uploading the pics. Pls. email me instead and I&#039;ll reply with the pics!","Attachments":[],"Id":576773,"PostDate":1233308145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hmm I seem to be having trouble uploading the pics. Pls. email me instead and I'll reply with the pics!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57cf0d2c3d46a62e5bb931f6a1eb10f3","RawContent":"The photographer&#039;s prices are ridiculous as well!! 450 ish for 30 pics. 770 ish for 60 pics. The photographer&#039;s I found in cancun charge anywhere from 600 for 3hrs of unlimited photos(plus you get them on a CD..all of them) and there&#039;s an amazing photographer (the minister that I hired..her husband) that has a 3 hr package for 800 ish...Don&#039;t forget about hiring a minister off the resort..it&#039;s cheaper. There are cheaper ones but mine is 350 plus 70 for a day pass. only $30 cheaper than the resort but she speakes english and seems really nice.\n \n I am still waiting for Ana to reply to my messages to put together finishing touches..she&#039;s a little pokey with the replies but she seems nice!! LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":576992,"PostDate":1233340820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The photographer's prices are ridiculous as well!! 450 ish for 30 pics. 770 ish for 60 pics. The photographer's I found in cancun charge anywhere from 600 for 3hrs of unlimited photos(plus you get them on a CD..all of them) and there's an amazing photographer (the minister that I hired..her husband) that has a 3 hr package for 800 ish...Don't forget about hiring a minister off the resort..it's cheaper. There are cheaper ones but mine is 350 plus 70 for a day pass. only $30 cheaper than the resort but she speakes english and seems really nice.<br \/> <br \/> I am still waiting for Ana to reply to my messages to put together finishing touches..she's a little pokey with the replies but she seems nice!! LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e39a8b71659800241942c6c6af8bd34","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;klink&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi,\n I am going to have my wedding at Ocean Coral and Turquesa on Feb. 7 2009. I have not been able to find anyone else who got married here- so thats a little nerve wracking. But the pictures look beautiful and the price is right! Have you been able to find any one to give you any more info or good sites regarding the Ocean Coral and Turquesa? \n Thanks\n Kaycee&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Kaycee,\n You must be leaving any day now! I just wanted to say all the best for what I&#039;m sure will be an amazing wedding! \n Jennie :)&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":579406,"PostDate":1233589827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>klink<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi,<br \/> I am going to have my wedding at Ocean Coral and Turquesa on Feb. 7 2009. I have not been able to find anyone else who got married here- so thats a little nerve wracking. But the pictures look beautiful and the price is right! Have you been able to find any one to give you any more info or good sites regarding the Ocean Coral and Turquesa? <br \/> Thanks<br \/> Kaycee<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Kaycee,<br \/> You must be leaving any day now! I just wanted to say all the best for what I'm sure will be an amazing wedding! <br \/> Jennie <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jennie & Dave<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;116\/st\/20100209\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f02c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f02c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jcrsby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227307174,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212805.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":130,"PhotoHeight":97,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JCrosby","Id":212805,"Name":"JCrosby","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49751cf30dae6c37ecff6a1322be835b","RawContent":"Good luck Kaycee!!!! All the reviews that I am reading lately are really good..you&#039;ll have a great time. Let us know how it went when you get back.....\n \n Re: Photography....got an e-mail from Ana regarding hiring a photographer off site..she said there is a 70 day pass plus a 200 fee for using an outside vendor. A little ridiculous but might be worth it compared to the work and price of the on-site one. found a couple good ones in Cancun if anyone wants their contact info, let me know.\n \n Have a great week girls, Shelley","Attachments":[],"Id":579437,"PostDate":1233600560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good luck Kaycee!!!! All the reviews that I am reading lately are really good..you'll have a great time. Let us know how it went when you get back.....<br \/> <br \/> Re: Photography....got an e-mail from Ana regarding hiring a photographer off site..she said there is a 70 day pass plus a 200 fee for using an outside vendor. A little ridiculous but might be worth it compared to the work and price of the on-site one. found a couple good ones in Cancun if anyone wants their contact info, let me know.<br \/> <br \/> Have a great week girls, Shelley\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48788be0b149897ee6ec513a721af696","RawContent":"Have an awesome weddingmoon Kaycee!\n Thank you for the photographer info Shelley, I am interested in using Cancun Photography, their prices are very reasonable :)\n Out of curiousity, did any of you specifically choose one side (ocean vs. turquesa) for your guests&#039; accomodations?","Attachments":[],"Id":579992,"PostDate":1233625147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have an awesome weddingmoon Kaycee!<br \/> Thank you for the photographer info Shelley, I am interested in using Cancun Photography, their prices are very reasonable <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> Out of curiousity, did any of you specifically choose one side (ocean vs. turquesa) for your guests' accomodations?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4bb5c9a5e659f8e2417b2ec25e0fa3b","RawContent":"bcbride- Although we didn&#039;t pick a side on purpose, we ended up just doing the ocean coral side (through signature). \n Did you hear anything back from Ana about the outside vendor fee discrepancy?","Attachments":[],"Id":582655,"PostDate":1233801109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                bcbride- Although we didn't pick a side on purpose, we ended up just doing the ocean coral side (through signature). <br \/> Did you hear anything back from Ana about the outside vendor fee discrepancy?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malina_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229916053,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"map","Id":213294,"Name":"map","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8dfb8689580146382086b5733a69b5d","RawContent":"No I haven&#039;t heard from her, will let you know what she says...\n But I think she is holding Dec. 16, 2009 for us! yay! \n Are any of you ladies having a symbolic wedding? We have decided to do that instead and have a civil wedding here after (if that is possible?, not sure if we would need to do it first)...","Attachments":[],"Id":583005,"PostDate":1233818689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                No I haven't heard from her, will let you know what she says...<br \/> But I think she is holding Dec. 16, 2009 for us! yay! <br \/> Are any of you ladies having a symbolic wedding? We have decided to do that instead and have a civil wedding here after (if that is possible?, not sure if we would need to do it first)...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"27597","Title":"Ocean Turquesa & Coral Brides?","LastPostDate":1431460229},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2400,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifi