,{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f6b11dc09ddb223db513cd0b0f9ac8b","RawContent":"Hi there, I emailed you the free wedding package info and the reception pics. There is also the other wedding packages file that you can download right from this thread. Good luck with the planning :)","Attachments":[],"Id":568260,"PostDate":1232611496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi there, I emailed you the free wedding package info and the reception pics. There is also the other wedding packages file that you can download right from this thread. Good luck with the planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a896e162a2cebd58515860dbbb0f977","RawContent":"I got the email! Thank you soooo much! I&#039;m really excited now...I hope everything works out for booking, wish me luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":568410,"PostDate":1232616665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got the email! Thank you soooo much! I'm really excited now...I hope everything works out for booking, wish me luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malina_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229916053,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"map","Id":213294,"Name":"map","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6fe8c108dc964abc6884049e826c154d","RawContent":"whereabouts in BC are you from? I am from Vancouver Island, and am considering Ocean Turquesa as it is one of the resorts that have more reasonable rates, everything just seem so much more expensive flying out of the west coast\/Vancouver &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; and I really like the look of the resort, so hopefully everything will work out!","Attachments":[],"Id":569663,"PostDate":1232701169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                whereabouts in BC are you from? I am from Vancouver Island, and am considering Ocean Turquesa as it is one of the resorts that have more reasonable rates, everything just seem so much more expensive flying out of the west coast\/Vancouver <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> and I really like the look of the resort, so hopefully everything will work out!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"418c247bbf55b79669cc2bcba4cb4fa1","RawContent":"I am in the Okanagan, but both of our immediate families are in Victoria, and the price point is exactly why we are going with the Ocean Coral\/Turquesa...that, and my TA has a collegue who had a bride get married there last month and said it was AMAZING!","Attachments":[],"Id":570127,"PostDate":1232749467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am in the Okanagan, but both of our immediate families are in Victoria, and the price point is exactly why we are going with the Ocean Coral\/Turquesa...that, and my TA has a collegue who had a bride get married there last month and said it was AMAZING!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malina_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229916053,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"map","Id":213294,"Name":"map","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d2ef9531df0774a03e48a8d47e981c3","RawContent":"Where in the Okanagan? My family lives in Penticton!! Been there many times...it&#039;s sooo nice.","Attachments":[],"Id":570752,"PostDate":1232823418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Where in the Okanagan? My family lives in Penticton!! Been there many times...it's sooo nice.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9be7e9f75111e5b44ad69b3ceec097e","RawContent":"Hi everyone, I received an email from Ana with answers to some of my specific questions..\n \n 1)Your Coral package includes a private dinner reception in the banquet hall. We are having 20 people and is it possible to have the reception in a different location? We would prefer outdoors, by the pool, or the outside lobby. yes, you can , but there will be an extra charge for having out door, the charge is $27 usd per person..for the whole group. \n 2)Do you also provide a dance floor, and\/or sound system? yes, we do provide the sound system, but dance floor is not include.it will be extra. \n 3)Do you also have a price list you can email to me for additional items such as flowers for the ceremony, bouquets for the bridesmaids, etc.? find attached the example and prices. \n 4)Does your resort have a photographer? yes, we do have on site photographer..find attached the information. \n \n ... If any of you are interested in their photographer&#039;s price list, I will try to attach it on here. I just emailed her again asking for sample pics of the photographer&#039;s work, unless some of you have them already? Hopefully she responds soon.&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;5679&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;PHOTOSHOP_ING.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:34,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":571956,"PostDate":1232947541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, I received an email from Ana with answers to some of my specific questions..<br \/> <br \/> 1)Your Coral package includes a private dinner reception in the banquet hall. We are having 20 people and is it possible to have the reception in a different location? We would prefer outdoors, by the pool, or the outside lobby. yes, you can , but there will be an extra charge for having out door, the charge is $27 usd per person..for the whole group. <br \/> 2)Do you also provide a dance floor, and\/or sound system? yes, we do provide the sound system, but dance floor is not include.it will be extra. <br \/> 3)Do you also have a price list you can email to me for additional items such as flowers for the ceremony, bouquets for the bridesmaids, etc.? find attached the example and prices. <br \/> 4)Does your resort have a photographer? yes, we do have on site photographer..find attached the information. <br \/> <br \/> ... If any of you are interested in their photographer's price list, I will try to attach it on here. I just emailed her again asking for sample pics of the photographer's work, unless some of you have them already? Hopefully she responds soon.<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"5679\",\"name\":\"PHOTOSHOP_ING.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":34,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natr@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1227947802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bcbride","Id":212920,"Name":"bcbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"928679720eaec4e6bd08604f72a4a87a","RawContent":"Hey everyone,\n I need some help, we are about to book our wedding for November and I was wondering for the people who know is there nightly entertainment and is there something to do with a group of 50 to do or are we going to be bored?\n Thanks so much,","Attachments":[],"Id":572598,"PostDate":1233012309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone,<br \/> I need some help, we are about to book our wedding for November and I was wondering for the people who know is there nightly entertainment and is there something to do with a group of 50 to do or are we going to be bored?<br \/> Thanks so much,\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@beyondsound.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232250881,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214048.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jordanandkeri","Id":214048,"Name":"jordanandkeri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74afa20fb1d69b814218194d83b0edf8","RawContent":"Silentderra- I am in Kamloops...so I guess not technically the Okanagan...but close enough :)\n \n bcbride- I would love to see the on-site photographers sample pics if Ana sends you some! I was planning on using a photographer from Cancun, but Ana told my TA that they don&#039;t allow external photographers unless they are a family member with your group.\n \n I now have a wedding date...hooray! And tommorow we will be booking our trip with Signature! In 24 hrs I will officially be an OTC bride!","Attachments":[],"Id":572838,"PostDate":1233022974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Silentderra- I am in Kamloops...so I guess not technically the Okanagan...but close enough <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> bcbride- I would love to see the on-site photographers sample pics if Ana sends you some! I was planning on using a photographer from Cancun, but Ana told my TA that they don't allow external photographers unless they are a family member with your group.<br \/> <br \/> I now have a wedding date...hooray! And tommorow we will be booking our trip with Signature! In 24 hrs I will officially be an OTC bride!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malina_p@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229916053,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213294.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"map","Id":213294,"Name":"map","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95ef9052988c173cb24c3b303d86b23f","RawContent":"WOW..can&#039;t hire a photographer off site....darn it!! I found a reasonably priced one and was about to book him tomorrow..glad I read your post! \n \n jorandker..I heard that the nightly entertainment was almost non-existant so I am a little worried.\n Soooo much to do..and sooo little time left..LOL a little panicky now 1.5 mths to go","Attachments":[],"Id":572940,"PostDate":1233028714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW..can't hire a photographer off site....darn it!! I found a reasonably priced one and was about to book him tomorrow..glad I read your post! <br \/> <br \/> jorandker..I heard that the nightly entertainment was almost non-existant so I am a little worried.<br \/> Soooo much to do..and sooo little time left..LOL a little panicky now 1.5 mths to go\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sbrown039@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231621971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213804.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"silentderra","Id":213804,"Name":"silentderra","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2400,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
