{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efdc3244687391cdebf1ba0874a32b90","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m pretty disappointed with the pricing of extras as well. The difference between the prices for centerpieces especially.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Laura is great at answering questions, but she doesn&#039;t provide prices or documents unless you ask for them explicitly. I&#039;ve been trying to start my invoice and get an idea at my total cost, but I keep having to pry for prices.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829642,"PostDate":1391000215,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm pretty disappointed with the pricing of extras as well. The difference between the prices for centerpieces especially.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Laura is great at answering questions, but she doesn't provide prices or documents unless you ask for them explicitly. I've been trying to start my invoice and get an idea at my total cost, but I keep having to pry for prices.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"150f1853cbec55d0c7202c17687f8894","RawContent":"Any luck on getting my prices from Laura? She hasn&#039;t responded to my emails yet. :-\/","Attachments":[],"Id":1829997,"PostDate":1391097661,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Any luck on getting my prices from Laura? She hasn't responded to my emails yet. :-\/\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddc74b61f50f42395f446bbab7d6523b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I heard back from her. She said:\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\"&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:Cambria, serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;The document showing photos of the centerpieces with pricing that is higher are more elaborate centerpiece. For around $45 USD, this would include the tropical flowers outlined in the attached document here and a small short centerpiece in a vase.\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;\"&gt;The attached document she was talking about was the outline of which bouquets come with each package. So basically roses, or gerber daisies, or birds of paradise, etc. in a small vase.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830112,"PostDate":1391109062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I heard back from her. She said:<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\"<span  style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102);font-family:Cambria, serif;font-size:15px\">The document showing photos of the centerpieces with pricing that is higher are more elaborate centerpiece. For around $45 USD, this would include the tropical flowers outlined in the attached document here and a small short centerpiece in a vase.\"<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:15px\">The attached document she was talking about was the outline of which bouquets come with each package. So basically roses, or gerber daisies, or birds of paradise, etc. in a small vase.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d76d908d3059ba4dedf9ae554a5543b9","RawContent":"Do you mind emailing me that outline? I have yet to receive that too. Janina27@live.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1830136,"PostDate":1391110959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do you mind emailing me that outline? I have yet to receive that too. Janina27@live.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37cea175200f0846ea48afda6656462e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2bMrsClark\"] Sending now!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830140,"PostDate":1391111071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276085\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276085-soon2bmrsclark\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bMrsClark<\/span><\/a> Sending now!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"198ebfa20974e7b8d013c17a34c7c7ad","RawContent":"Thannnnnnk you so much!!!!! \u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f","Attachments":[],"Id":1830142,"PostDate":1391111241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thannnnnnk you so much!!!!! \u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\u263a\ufe0f\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.168.109.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a00063f22f8ef4db1c612cf08f3c615","RawContent":"@[member=\"cottagegirl\"] I have a travel agent that has been my liasion with some questions but nothing directly with the resort. I had asked about making a group reservation for my welcome dinner the first night but I am waiting for a reply. Since there&#039;s no reservation system, not too sure what options I have. All my guests are arriving together, so I am also trying to arrange a group check in.","Attachments":[],"Id":1830331,"PostDate":1391136762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276105\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276105-cottagegirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cottagegirl<\/span><\/a> I have a travel agent that has been my liasion with some questions but nothing directly with the resort. I had asked about making a group reservation for my welcome dinner the first night but I am waiting for a reply. Since there's no reservation system, not too sure what options I have. All my guests are arriving together, so I am also trying to arrange a group check in. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Vibianna.wong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.168.109.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1375587654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272224.jpg?_r=1390709134","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vANDm","Id":272224,"Name":"vANDm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.50.193.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eec46c97c0a972136e4f35154a26d2ab","RawContent":"Hey ladies!!!! I found an outside florist in punta cana. They are full service and from what I&#039;ve read, waaaaaay more reasonable in prices. I sent them an email. I will keep you all posted!!! &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830382,"PostDate":1391144277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies!!!! I found an outside florist in punta cana. They are full service and from what I've read, waaaaaay more reasonable in prices. I sent them an email. I will keep you all posted!!! <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingsandeventsinpuntacana.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingsa...inpuntacana.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c3719083ec983b715e6ca97ecf5c3d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2bMrsClark\"] Let me know if you get any pricing info! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I sent some pictures to Laura of bouquets and centerpieces I like and she&#039;s getting me a quote on them. I will let everyone know what kind of prices she comes back with.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830445,"PostDate":1391171608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276085\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276085-soon2bmrsclark\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bMrsClark<\/span><\/a> Let me know if you get any pricing info! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I sent some pictures to Laura of bouquets and centerpieces I like and she's getting me a quote on them. I will let everyone know what kind of prices she comes back with.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":fals