to be Mrs. Thiam ","Email":"timairee.s.sutton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1376225647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272458.jpg?_r=1389190783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWBride2015","Id":272458,"Name":"DWBride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7930f2c9566a26f669b699468fa0e09d","RawContent":"Is there anyone getting married dierectly at the Royalton? I&#039;ve been talking to Laura about prices for things, and they are so over priced for everything. The are double and trip the cost for flower arrangements. I got a quote from a nearby florist and it&#039;s a fraction of the cost but I have to pay almost $500 fee just to bring the flowers into the resort. It&#039;s ridiculous.  I&#039;m so discouraged. Smh :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1832276,"PostDate":1391713300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is there anyone getting married dierectly at the Royalton? I've been talking to Laura about prices for things, and they are so over priced for everything. The are double and trip the cost for flower arrangements. I got a quote from a nearby florist and it's a fraction of the cost but I have to pay almost $500 fee just to bring the flowers into the resort. It's ridiculous.  I'm so discouraged. Smh <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janina27@live.com","IpAddress":"23.30.18.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389740255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276085.jpg?_r=1389741323","PhotoWidth":118,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2bMrsClark","Id":276085,"Name":"Soon2bMrsClark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"134.53.244.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e17b8f7d05bcea8c176abe9f90e0c081","RawContent":"I am getting married at the resort but I haven&#039;t talked to Laura about prices recently. I wonder if she would be willing to send a copy of the contract if it has prices listed. My plan is wedding 5pm , semi-private dinner ,some type of reception with music not sure yet. But I am only bringing less than 20 people.","Attachments":[],"Id":1832964,"PostDate":1392055567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married at the resort but I haven't talked to Laura about prices recently. I wonder if she would be willing to send a copy of the contract if it has prices listed. My plan is wedding 5pm , semi-private dinner ,some type of reception with music not sure yet. But I am only bringing less than 20 people.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Stewarjs2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.102.197.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385329037,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275292.jpg?_r=1387054671","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bigleap35","Id":275292,"Name":"Bigleap35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00cab7c2a84d2d01aa6bbab3773e69af","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"DWBride2015\"] I haven&#039;t asked her about a welcome dinner yet.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My last e-mail to her was a week ago to ask for an official price quote on everything I&#039;ve chosen so far and she hasn&#039;t responded yet.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I plan to ask if the semi-private reservation included in the wedding packages can be used for a welcome dinner, since I&#039;m paying to have a private reception instead on my wedding day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833318,"PostDate":1392212396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272458\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272458-dwbride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DWBride2015<\/span><\/a> I haven't asked her about a welcome dinner yet.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My last e-mail to her was a week ago to ask for an official price quote on everything I've chosen so far and she hasn't responded yet.<\/p>\n<p>I plan to ask if the semi-private reservation included in the wedding packages can be used for a welcome dinner, since I'm paying to have a private reception instead on my wedding day.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.205.68.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f53d7c029b0a79db67586e853d569f74","RawContent":"Ok, thanks @[member=\"Potter8\"]. I wanted to do something for my guest on there first night.","Attachments":[],"Id":1833471,"PostDate":1392261728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273981\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/273981-potter8\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Potter8<\/span><\/a>. I wanted to do something for my guest on there first night. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Soon to be Mrs. Thiam ","Email":"timairee.s.sutton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.233.229.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1376225647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272458.jpg?_r=1389190783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWBride2015","Id":272458,"Name":"DWBride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.23.224.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec35f7596e024c40f662202b6c767299","RawContent":"Hi everyone, \n\nMy date is May 3 and like many of you just finding out about the hidden costs. My group right now is about 50 people with the majority coming from Philadelphia.  I used Destination Weddings to coordinate the travel and I really don&#039;t have anything nice to say about them right now. I have also been dealing with Laura. I haven&#039;t decided which package I&#039;ll go with yet mostly because the the new packages are more expensive and you get less. She emailed me yesterday that the price per person outside of the package of 20 people will be $20 pp. That covers the chair, cake, and sparkling wine toast. She did also say the menu prices were gonna drop as well. I&#039;m glad to finally find a community of Royalton Brides. Congratulations to everyone.","Attachments":[],"Id":1833577,"PostDate":1392321534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone, <br>\nMy date is May 3 and like many of you just finding out about the hidden costs. My group right now is about 50 people with the majority coming from Philadelphia.  I used Destination Weddings to coordinate the travel and I really don't have anything nice to say about them right now. I have also been dealing with Laura. I haven't decided which package I'll go with yet mostly because the the new packages are more expensive and you get less. She emailed me yesterday that the price per person outside of the package of 20 people will be $20 pp. That covers the chair, cake, and sparkling wine toast. She did also say the menu prices were gonna drop as well. I'm glad to finally find a community of Royalton Brides. Congratulations to everyone.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kadeidra262wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.23.224.87","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392320823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"KaDeidra262","Id":276693,"Name":"KaDeidra262","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75274,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e4a7878702b085ce3de32ea2e2c0c67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KaDeidra262\"] She didn&#039;t mention anything to me about lowering menu prices! If she sends you a new menu, would you mind sharing? :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This process is getting frustrating. I have to agree with @[member=\"Soon2bMrsClark\"], the flower prices are far too high.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But, I just read this review, which may ease your minds a little:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d4939796-r193907791-Royalton_Punta_Cana_Resort_Casino-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Re.html#CHECK_RATES_CONT&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d4939796-r193907791-Royalton_Punta_Cana_Resort_Casino-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Re.html#CHECK_RATES_CONT&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833702,"PostDate":1392397722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276693\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276693-kadeidra262\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KaDeidra262<\/span><\/a> She didn't mention anything to me about lowering menu prices! If she sends you a new menu, would you mind sharing? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This process is getting frustrating. I have to agree with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276085\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276085-soon2bmrsclark\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bMrsClark<\/span><\/a>, the flower prices are far too high.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But, I just read this review, which may ease your minds a little:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.ca\/ShowUserReviews-g147293-d4939796-r193907791-Royalton_Punta_Cana_Resort_Casino-Punta_Cana_La_Altagracia_Province_Dominican_Re.html#CHECK_RATES_CONT' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis...HECK_RATES_CONT<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbiehodder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"192.65.239.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380825806,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273981.jpg?_r=1391111427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Potter8","Id":273981,"Name":"Potter8","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":161,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
