downs of planning my destination wedding. I had difficulty finding recent reviews of the Hilton Rose Hall in Montego Bay so I wanted to write a review after visiting for the 1st time last week.\n\n\nThey have 2 beautiful gazebos that can accommodate 10 to over 100 guests and also offer ceremonies and receptions on the sand. The beautiful Aqueduct is also a short walk away and absolutely breathtaking in person.\n\n\nThis resort will be perfect for our guests with children due to the onsite lazy river, water slides and the fact kids 12 and under stay free. Our other guests will also be thrilled to see they have an adults only beach section and nightly entertainment.\n\n\nFresh, their buffet restaurant, was great.  We had breakfast and dinner there and it was yummy. We also had an amazing steak dinner at Three Palms.  They have free shuttles to the local stores and great house that run every 30 minutes and shuttles to the restaurants and clubs on the Hip Strip.  \n\n\nI know every single guest will be impressed with their stay which is a huge relief since they are spending time and money for our wedding.  Our coordinator, Angella Saddler has been amazing.  Even when my wedding was 10 months out she still responded to my millions of questions in a timely manner and was an amazing host during our stay.\n\n\nIf anyone has any questions please let me know but I truly hope this review encourages others to check them out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1894816,"PostDate":1430310777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello all. This forum has been extremely helpful for me through the ups and downs of planning my destination wedding. I had difficulty finding recent reviews of the Hilton Rose Hall in Montego Bay so I wanted to write a review after visiting for the 1st time last week.<br><br>\nThey have 2 beautiful gazebos that can accommodate 10 to over 100 guests and also offer ceremonies and receptions on the sand. The beautiful Aqueduct is also a short walk away and absolutely breathtaking in person.<br><br>\nThis resort will be perfect for our guests with children due to the onsite lazy river, water slides and the fact kids 12 and under stay free. Our other guests will also be thrilled to see they have an adults only beach section and nightly entertainment.<br><br>\nFresh, their buffet restaurant, was great.  We had breakfast and dinner there and it was yummy. We also had an amazing steak dinner at Three Palms.  They have free shuttles to the local stores and great house that run every 30 minutes and shuttles to the restaurants and clubs on the Hip Strip.  <br><br>\nI know every single guest will be impressed with their stay which is a huge relief since they are spending time and money for our wedding.  Our coordinator, Angella Saddler has been amazing.  Even when my wedding was 10 months out she still responded to my millions of questions in a timely manner and was an amazing host during our stay.<br><br>\nIf anyone has any questions please let me know but I truly hope this review encourages others to check them out.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421707270,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79127,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68167ca8f47f7a0c9633f51024d9530f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for posting this! Rose Hall was a resort we looked at but ended up being out of our budget. We were married in Jamaica nearly 4 years ago but at the Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica. We loved the island and have tried a couple of times to go back. We&#039;ll get there eventually. One of the things we loved about Jamaica was how easy it was to get legally married without a lot of expense and paperwork. Oh and our anniversary date is also October but the 20th.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894911,"PostDate":1430364806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for posting this! Rose Hall was a resort we looked at but ended up being out of our budget. We were married in Jamaica nearly 4 years ago but at the Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica. We loved the island and have tried a couple of times to go back. We'll get there eventually. One of the things we loved about Jamaica was how easy it was to get legally married without a lot of expense and paperwork. Oh and our anniversary date is also October but the 20th.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79127,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ffc42eff6bc153dfc46647dc26b7d3c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just Google the resort and I am definitely adding this resort to my vacation bucket list. It looks gorgeous and I can only imagine in person, it&#039;s even more wonderful :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894969,"PostDate":1430425397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just Google the resort and I am definitely adding this resort to my vacation bucket list. It looks gorgeous and I can only imagine in person, it's even more wonderful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79127","Title":"Hilton Rose Hall Review","LastPostDate":1430425397},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
